 dualPane mounts it; geometry assertions plausible (row panes ~250px height each). JS query string exactly matches CSS media query. Portrait-tablet/desktop unaffected. (B) FOUND REGRESSION #1 (IMPORTANT): `.app{height:100dvh;overflow:hidden}` + stages keeping min-height:240px OUTSIDE the ≥700px landscape query clips the toolbar with NO scroll on (i) sub-700px landscape phones (iPhone SE/8 class 568-667px wide: header 56+tabbar 48+toolbar 64+stage 240+margins ≈ 424 > 375) and (ii) short split-screen portrait (e.g. 390x400); previously `.app{min-height:100dvh}` let the document scroll so toolbar was reachable. Fix: also relax min-height (e.g. `@media (orientation: landscape){.workspace-stage,.preview-stage{min-height:0}}` or max-height query) — untested by the plan's viewport matrix. (C) FOUND BUG #2 (IMPORTANT): T5 wheel burst reads `layer.transform` via options.getSession() → Workspace propsRef → EditorScreen prop → DesignerApp `getSession={()=>session}` render closure. Multiple wheel events in one synchronous task (real trackpad bursts; plan's own test loop) all read the same stale transform; each update-gesture patch is ABSOLUTE (mergeTransform {...base,...patch}) so last-write-wins — same-frame deltas are silently discarded, under-scaling fast scrolls. Plan's own tests won't catch it (uniformity + undo count still hold). Fix: DesignerApp should pass `getSession={() => sessionRef.current}` (sessionRef already updated synchronously in commitSession) — safe, controller is the only consumer. (D) Nesting/undo duplication/timer leak analysis: pending-state machine in state.ts prevents duplicate undo; prose instruction to call finishWheelGesture() before pointer/keyboard is adequate (keyboard patch-transform would otherwise be silently DROPPED while pending!==null per state.ts default branch, and undo blocked — worth noting in finding C fix or as its own note); destroy path cancelWheelGesture matches existing destroy semantics; harness test enforces begin→cancel. (E) Handle clamping consistent: only handles clamped; pointInFootprint uses half sizes (unchanged); same bounded footprint used for draw + hit test per plan; rotate/scale gestures are delta/ratio-based so clamped handle positions cause no jump; minor cosmetic risk that clamped scale+rotate handles can coincide on the same corner for oversized art (rotate checked first) — MINOR at most. (F) Pure bounds test math verified: raw scaleHandle (1092.5,879.5)→clamp(569,543), rotate (292.5,-356.5)→(292.5,16); existing no-bounds test unchanged. (G) T2 welcome open race-safe: stale guard prevents replacing a session started during async open; no asset leak (result.assets added only after guard); OPEN_INVALID_MESSAGE contains \"can't be opened\" so invalid test is valid; openInput helper matches the welcome-branch input; inputClickSpy pattern already exists; itemNames ordering ['Picture 1','Color 1'] correct (top-first). (H) T4 wheel math verified: deltaY -240 → distance*exp(-0.36)≈0.7 → zoom in → bigger red panel; clamp at MIN 4 caps width; +1000 zooms out; resetView restores exact camera → toBeCloseTo(before,0) OK; listener registered/removed correctly; deltaMode normalization reasonable. (I) T6 CSS verified sufficient: .sheet is flex column, .more-form default flex-shrink 1 + min-height:0 enables internal scroll, Done flex 0 0 auto anchored; SheetBackdrop target-equality pattern correct; other sheets unaffected (onDismiss undefined). Escape effect deps churn harmless. (J) No feature creep found: every task traces to the two approved specs or the audit findings; all are completion/removal of existing UI. (K) Task 7 scripts all exist in package.json; e2e baseURL proven by existing smoke spec; honest check:release exit-1 gate preserved.","Remaining to verify before writing verdict: (1) shirt/pants template dims are actually 585x559 in src/domain/registry (bounds test + redPanelWidth fixture depend on it); (2) playwright.config.ts has a chromium project for `--project=chromium`; (3) whether README opening paragraph exists for T7 insertion point. Then write final review: VERDICT leaning APPROVE WITH CHANGES with findings: #1 IMPORTANT plan Task 1 Step 6 / src/styles.css — fixed-height overflow-hidden shell clips toolbar on sub-700px landscape + short portrait viewports (specific fix: relax stage min-height outside the ≥700 landscape query); #2 IMPORTANT plan Task 5 Step 4 / src/editor/ui/designer-app.tsx:775 (getSession closure) — stale transform in wheel bursts discards same-frame deltas (fix: pass sessionRef.current getter; also ensures keyboard patch-transform isn't dropped while burst pending); possibly #3 MINOR gestures.ts clamped handles can coincide for oversized art (rotate wins) — acceptable/known. No BLOCKER found. Output format per instructions: single VERDICT line then `- SEVERITY - file:line - failure - fix` lines, then assumptions/gaps section (state unverified: real-device behavior, Brave CDP path, check-bundle budgets, registry dims if unread)."]} failed
