ding machine prevents duplicate undo; destroy cancelWheelGesture matches existing semantics; harness test enforces begin→cancel. (E) Handle clamping consistent (handles only; hit test unchanged; delta/ratio gestures no jump); minor: clamped scale+rotate handles can coincide on same corner for oversized art (rotate wins) — MINOR. (F) Pure bounds math verified: raw (1092.5,879.5)→(569,543); (292.5,-356.5)→(292.5,16). (G) T2 race-safe: stale guard prevents replacing session started during async open; no asset leak (result.assets added only after guard); welcome input matches openInput helper. (H) T4 math verified: -240 → exp(-0.36)≈0.7 zoom in; clamp at MIN 4; reset exact. (I) T6 CSS sufficient: .sheet flex column, .more-form default flex-shrink:1 + min-height:0 enables scroll; Done anchored; SheetBackdrop target-equality correct; other sheets unaffected. (J) No feature creep: all tasks trace to approved specs/audit. (K) Task 7 scripts all exist; honest check:release gate preserved.\n\nRemaining before verdict: (1) verify shirt/pants template dims 585x559 in src/domain/registry; (2) playwright.config.ts has chromium project for `--project=chromium`; (3) README opening paragraph for T7 insertion. Then final review: VERDICT leaning APPROVE WITH CHANGES; findings: #1 IMPORTANT plan Task 1 Step 6 / src/styles.css — fixed-height overflow-hidden shell clips toolbar on sub-700px landscape + short portrait (fix: relax stage min-height outside ≥700 landscape query); #2 IMPORTANT plan Task 5 Step 4 + designer-app.tsx:775 — stale transform in wheel bursts discards same-frame deltas (fix: pass sessionRef.current getter; ensures keyboard/undo not dropped while pending); possible #3 MINOR clamped handles coincidence for oversized art. No BLOCKER."}],"topic":"Plan review: materials read, analysis"}
